#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:2
msgid "Deploy Prometheus and Grafana for performance monitoring"
msgstr "성능 모니터링을 위한 Prometheus 및 Grafana 배포"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-ent.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Enterprise, and Enterprise "
"Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ (not available on "
