#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:7
msgid ""
"Performance monitoring support enables admins to track system health for "
"large Enterprise deployments through integrations with `Prometheus "
"<https://prometheus.io/>`_ and `Grafana <https://grafana.com/>`__. These "
"integrations support data collection from several Mattermost servers, "
"which is particularly useful if you're running Mattermost :doc:`in high "
"availability mode </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-"
"based-deployment>`. Once you're tracking system health, you can :doc:`set"
" up performance alerts </administration-guide/scale/performance-"
"alerting>` on your Grafana dashboard."
msgstr ""
"성능 모니터링 지원을 통해 관리자는 `Prometheus <https://prometheus.io/>`_ 및 "
"`Grafana <https://grafana.com/>`__\\ 와의 통합으로 대규모 엔터프라이즈 배포의 시스템 "
"상태를 추적할 수 있습니다. 이러한 통합은 여러 OKR.BEST 서버에서 데이터를 수집할 수 "
"있게 하며, OKR.BEST를 :doc:`고가용성 모드 </administration-guide/scale/high-"
"availability-cluster-based-deployment>`\\ 로 실행하는 경우 특히 유용합니다. 시스템 "
"상태를 추적하기 시작하면 Grafana 대시보드에서 :doc:`성능 알림을 설정 "
"</administration-guide/scale/performance-alerting>`\\ 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:9
msgid ""
"Admins can collect and store various data points from the Mattermost "
"application in an `OpenMetrics <https://openmetrics.io>`_ format by "
"`deploying Prometheus <#install-prometheus>`_ and `Grafana <#install-"
"grafana>`_."
msgstr ""
"관리자는 `Prometheus 배포 <#install-prometheus>`_\\ 와 `Grafana <#install-"
"grafana>`_ 배포를 통해 OKR.BEST 애플리케이션의 다양한 데이터 포인트를 `OpenMetrics "
"<https://openmetrics.io>`_ 형식으로 수집하고 저장할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:13
msgid ""
"Don't want to deploy Prometheus and Grafana? You can also :doc:`collect "
"performance metrics using the Mattermost Metrics plugin </administration-"
"guide/scale/collect-performance-metrics>`."
msgstr ""
"Prometheus와 Grafana를 배포하고 싶지 않나요? :doc:`OKR.BEST Metrics 플러그인을 "
"사용해 성능 지표를 수집 </administration-guide/scale/collect-performance-"
"metrics>`\\ 할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:16
msgid "Install Prometheus"
msgstr "Prometheus 설치"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:20
#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:84
msgid ""
"While Prometheus and Grafana may be installed on the same server as "
"Mattermost, we recommend installing these integrations on separate "
"servers, and configure Prometheus to pull all metrics from Mattermost and"
" other connected servers."
msgstr ""
"Prometheus와 Grafana를 OKR.BEST와 동일한 서버에 설치할 수도 있지만, 이러한 통합은 "
"별도의 서버에 설치하고 Prometheus가 OKR.BEST 및 기타 연결된 서버에서 모든 지표를 "
"가져오도록 구성하는 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Download a precompiled binary for Prometheus "
"<https://prometheus.io/download/>`_. Binaries are provided for many "
"popular distributions, including Darwin, Linux, and Windows. For "
"installation instructions, see the `Prometheus install guides "
"<https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/getting_started/>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Prometheus용 미리 컴파일된 바이너리를 다운로드 "
"<https://prometheus.io/download/>`_\\ 합니다. 바이너리는 Darwin, Linux, Windows를 "
"포함한 많은 인기 배포판에 제공됩니다. 설치 방법은 `Prometheus 설치 가이드 "
"<https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/getting_started/>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:24
msgid ""
"The following settings are recommended in the Prometheus configuration "
"file named ``prometheus.yml``:"
msgstr ""
"``prometheus.yml``\\ 이라는 Prometheus 구성 파일에서 다음 설정을 권장합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:59
msgid ""
"Replace the ``<hostname1>:<port>`` parameter with your Mattermost host IP"
" address and port to scrape the data. It connects to ``/metrics`` using "
"HTTP."
msgstr ""
"데이터를 스크랩하려면 ``<hostname1>:<port>`` 매개변수를 OKR.BEST 호스트 IP 주소와 "
"포트로 바꿉니다. HTTP를 사용해 ``/metrics``\\ 에 연결합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the Mattermost System Console, go to **Environment > Performance "
"Monitoring** to set **Enable Performance Monitoring** to **true**, then "
"specify the **Listen Address** (port-only, e.g., ``8067``), and select "
"**Save**. See our :ref:`Configuration Settings <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:performance "
"monitoring>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에서 **환경 > 성능 모니터링**\\ 으로 이동해 **성능 모니터링 "
"활성화**\\ 를 **true**\\ 로 설정한 다음, **수신 주소**(포트만, 예: ``8067``)를 "
"지정하고 **저장**\\ 을 선택합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`구성 설정 <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:performance monitoring>` "
"문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:63
msgid ""
"Enable performance monitoring options in the System Console by going to "
"Environment > Performance Monitoring, then specifying a listen address."
msgstr ""
"관리자 도구에서 환경 > 성능 모니터링으로 이동한 뒤 수신 주소를 지정하여 성능 "
"모니터링 옵션을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:67
msgid "To test that the server is running, go to ``<ip>:<port>/metrics``."
msgstr "서버가 실행 중인지 테스트하려면 ``<ip>:<port>/metrics``\\ 로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:70
msgid ""
"A Mattermost Enterprise license is required to connect to ``/metrics`` "
"using HTTP."
msgstr ""
"HTTP를 사용해 ``/metrics``\\ 에 연결하려면 Mattermost Enterprise 라이선스가 "
"필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:72
msgid ""
"Finally, run ``vi prometheus.yml`` to finish configuring Prometheus. For "
"starting the Prometheus service, read the `comprehensive guides provided "
"by Prometheus "
"<https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/getting_started/>`_."
msgstr ""
"마지막으로 ``vi prometheus.yml``\\ 을 실행해 Prometheus 구성을 완료합니다. "
"Prometheus 서비스를 시작하는 방법은 `Prometheus에서 제공하는 종합 가이드 "
"<https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/getting_started/>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:74
msgid ""
"Once the service has started, you can access the data in "
"``<localhost>:<port>/graph``. While you can use the Prometheus service to"
" create graphs, we'll focus on creating metric and analytics dashboards "
"in Grafana."
msgstr ""
"서비스가 시작되면 ``<localhost>:<port>/graph``\\ 에서 데이터에 접근할 수 있습니다. "
"Prometheus 서비스를 사용해 그래프를 만들 수도 있지만, 여기서는 Grafana에서 지표 및 "
"분석 대시보드를 만드는 데 집중합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:77
msgid ""
"For troubleshooting advice, check the `Prometheus FAQ page "
"<https://prometheus.io/docs/introduction/faq/>`_."
msgstr ""
"문제 해결 조언은 `Prometheus FAQ 페이지 "
"<https://prometheus.io/docs/introduction/faq/>`_\\ 를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:80
msgid "Install Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana 설치"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:86
msgid ""
"`Download a precompiled binary for Grafana "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-"
"grafana/installation/debian/>`_ on Ubuntu or Debian. Binaries are also "
"available for other distributions, including Redhat, Windows and Mac. For"
" install instructions, see `Grafana install guides "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-"
"grafana/installation/debian/>`_"
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu 또는 Debian에서 `Grafana용 미리 컴파일된 바이너리를 다운로드 "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/installation/debian/>`_"
"\\ 합니다. 바이너리는 Redhat, Windows, Mac을 포함한 다른 배포판에도 제공됩니다. 설치 "
"방법은 `Grafana 설치 가이드 <https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-"
"grafana/installation/debian/>`_\\ 를 참고하세요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:88
msgid ""
"The Grafana package is installed as a service, so it is easy to start the"
" server. See their `install guides "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-"
"grafana/installation/debian/>`_ to learn more."
msgstr ""
"Grafana 패키지는 서비스로 설치되므로 서버를 쉽게 시작할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 "
"`설치 가이드 <https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-"
"grafana/installation/debian/>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:90
msgid ""
"The default HTTP port is ``3000`` and default username and password are "
"``admin``."
msgstr ""
"기본 HTTP 포트는 ``3000``\\ 이며 기본 사용자 이름과 비밀번호는 ``admin``\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:92
msgid ""
"Add a Mattermost data source with the following settings as defined in "
