msgstr ""
"아래 스크린샷에 정의된 다음 설정으로 Mattermost 데이터 소스를 추가합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:94
msgid "Mattermost data source configuration settings for a Grafana installation."
msgstr "Grafana 설치를 위한 Mattermost 데이터 소스 구성 설정입니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:99
msgid ""
"For troubleshooting advice, check the `Grafana Troubleshooting page "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/troubleshooting/>`_."
msgstr ""
"문제 해결 조언은 `Grafana 문제 해결 페이지 "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/troubleshooting/>`_\\ 를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:100
msgid ""
"For user guides and tutorials, check the `Grafana documentation to learn "
"more <https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/>`_."
msgstr ""
"사용자 가이드와 튜토리얼은 `Grafana 문서 "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/>`_\\ 를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:103
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "시작하기"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:105
msgid ""
"To help you get started, you can download three sample dashboards shared "
"in Grafana:"
msgstr ""
"시작하는 데 도움이 되도록 Grafana에 공유된 샘플 대시보드를 다운로드할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:109
msgid ""
"See `this Grafana guide <https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/v7.5/dashboards"
"/export-import/>`_ to learn how to import Grafana dashboards either from "
"the UI or from the HTTP API."
msgstr ""
"UI 또는 HTTP API에서 Grafana 대시보드를 가져오는 방법은 `이 Grafana 가이드 "
"<https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/v7.5/dashboards/export-import/>`_\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:111
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Performance Monitoring v2 "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/15582-mattermost-performance-"
"monitoring-v2/>`_, which contains detailed charts for performance "
"monitoring including application, cluster, job server, and system "
"metrics."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Performance Monitoring v2 "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/15582-mattermost-performance-"
"monitoring-v2/>`_: 애플리케이션, 클러스터, 작업 서버, 시스템 지표를 포함한 성능 "
"모니터링을 위한 상세 차트가 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:112
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Notification Health Monitoring "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/21305-mattermost-notification-"
"health/>`_, which can be used to track different types of notifications "
"sent from Mattermost. Accessing and enabling Mattermost Notification "
"Health Monitoring requires the feature flag ``NotificationMonitoring`` to"
" be set to ``true``. System admins can :ref:`disable notification "
"monitoring data collection <administration-guide/configure/site-"
"configuration-settings:enable notification monitoring>` through the "
"System Console."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Notification Health Monitoring "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/21305-mattermost-notification-"
"health/>`_: OKR.BEST에서 전송된 다양한 유형의 알림을 추적하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다. "
"OKR.BEST 알림 상태 모니터링에 접근하고 활성화하려면 기능 플래그 "
"``NotificationMonitoring``\\ 을 ``true``\\ 로 설정해야 합니다. 시스템 관리자는 관리자 "
"도구를 통해 :ref:`알림 모니터링 데이터 수집을 비활성화 <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:enable notification monitoring>`\\ 할 "
"수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:113
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Web App Performance Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/21460-web-app-metrics/>`_, which "
"contains detailed metrics for client-side performance, including web "
"vitals and Mattermost-specifc metrics."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Web App Performance Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/21460-web-app-metrics/>`_: 웹 바이탈과 "
"OKR.BEST 고유 지표를 포함한 클라이언트 측 성능에 대한 상세 지표가 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:114
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Desktop App Performance Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/22736-desktop-app-metrics/>`_, "
"which contains detailed metrics for client-side desktop performance, "
"including CPU and memory usage metrics."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Desktop App Performance Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/22736-desktop-app-metrics/>`_: CPU 및 "
"메모리 사용량 지표를 포함한 클라이언트 측 데스크톱 성능에 대한 상세 지표가 들어 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:115
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Mobile App Performance Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/21695-mobile-performance-"
"metrics/>`_, which contains detailed metrics for client-side mobile "
"performance, including web vitals and Mattermost-specifc metrics."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Mobile App Performance Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/21695-mobile-performance-metrics/>`_: "
"웹 바이탈과 OKR.BEST 고유 지표를 포함한 클라이언트 측 모바일 성능에 대한 상세 지표가 "
"들어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:116
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Threaded Discussion Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/15581-collapsed-reply-threads-"
"performance/>`_, which contains detailed metrics on the queries involved "
"in our threaded discussions feature."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Threaded Discussion Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/15581-collapsed-reply-threads-"
"performance/>`_: 스레드 토론 기능과 관련된 쿼리에 대한 상세 지표가 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:117
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Performance KPI Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/2539-mattermost-performance-kpi-"
"metrics/>`_, which contains key metrics for monitoring performance and "
"system health."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Performance KPI Metrics "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/2539-mattermost-performance-kpi-"
"metrics/>`_: 성능과 시스템 상태를 모니터링하기 위한 핵심 지표가 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:118
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Performance Monitoring (Bonus Metrics) "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/2545-mattermost-performance-"
"monitoring-bonus-metrics/>`_, which contains additional metrics such as "
"emails sent or files uploaded, which may be important to monitor in some "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Performance Monitoring (Bonus Metrics) "
"<https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/2545-mattermost-performance-"
"monitoring-bonus-metrics/>`_: 일부 배포에서 모니터링이 중요할 수 있는, 전송된 "
"이메일이나 업로드된 파일 등의 추가 지표가 들어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:121
msgid "What's collected?"
msgstr "무엇이 수집되나요?"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.rst:123
msgid ""
"Mattermost provides :ref:`custom metrics <administration-guide/scale"
"/performance-monitoring-metrics:custom Mattermost metrics>` and "
":ref:`standard Go metrics <administration-guide/scale/performance-"
"monitoring-metrics:standard go metrics>` that can be used to monitor your"
" system's performance."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 시스템 성능을 모니터링하는 데 사용할 수 있는 :ref:`사용자 정의 지표 "
"<administration-guide/scale/performance-monitoring-metrics:custom Mattermost "
"metrics>`\\ 와 :ref:`표준 Go 지표 <administration-guide/scale/performance-"
